{
  "description": "EFF-05 canonicalization vectors: NFC-normalize strings, forbid floats, serialize with RFC 8785 (JCS), SHA-256 of UTF-8 bytes. Array order is significant. Implementations in every language MUST reproduce 'canonical' and 'sha256' exactly. Object keys are sorted by UTF-16 code units (RFC 8785 §3.2.3), not by code points. Integer -0 is serialized as 0. 'input_json' entries are raw JSON text to be parsed by the implementation.",
